---
title: Shared notes and a revision feedback loop
---
flowchart LR
  Prompt["Writing prompt"]
  Planner["Outline planner"]
  Writer["Draft writer"]
  Reviewer["Draft reviewer"]
  Publisher["Page publisher"]
  Reader["Page reader"]
  Feedback["Revision suggestions"]
  Store[("Shared note store")]

  Prompt -->|start an outline| Planner
  Planner -->|section plan| Writer
  Writer -->|draft text| Reviewer
  Reviewer -->|accepted draft| Publisher
  Reviewer -->|requested edits| Writer
  Publisher -->|published page| Reader
  Reader -->|observations| Feedback
  Feedback -->|revise the next outline| Planner
  Planner -->|save outline notes| Store
  Store -->|retrieve source notes| Writer
  Reviewer -->|save review notes| Store
  Store -->|retrieve accepted text| Publisher
